WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:01.380
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:02.048 --> 00:00:04.264
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> We stayed at The Langham for two nights.

3
00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:08.506
It’s a wonderful place – a very elegant, very English hotel.

4
00:00:09.029 --> 00:00:14.172
The service, atmosphere, and room were excellent and we really enjoyed our stay.

5
00:00:14.529 --> 00:00:17.145
But we had a very strange experience.

6
00:00:17.535 --> 00:00:24.793
On the first night we woke up at about five thirty. There was a strange noise outside our door.

7
00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:28.534
It was like somebody was scratching the door with their fingers.

8
00:00:31.039 --> 00:00:34.201
To tell you the truth, we were a little bit frightened.

9
00:00:34.512 --> 00:00:39.021
Then we thought that probably it was other guests coming back late from a party,

10
00:00:39.244 --> 00:00:42.718
maybe they were drunk or something, and we went back to sleep.

11
00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:46.848
But the second night exactly the same thing happened.

12
00:00:49.253 --> 00:00:54.029
So, we just thought, strange, maybe it’s because it’s an old hotel.

13
00:00:54.441 --> 00:00:59.150
But when we got home, we told the story to a friend, and he told us

14
00:00:59.217 --> 00:01:01.176
that The Langham is haunted.

15
00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:08.134
We looked on the internet, and we read that people say that room three three three has a ghost!

16
00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:12.198
And our room was three three two, the next room!

17
00:01:12.665 --> 00:01:15.838
We sent an email to The Langham and told them about it

18
00:01:15.972 --> 00:01:20.247
and they sent us some really interesting information about the ghost stories.

19
00:01:20.759 --> 00:01:24.299
We’d really like to stay in this fantastic hotel again,

20
00:01:24.544 --> 00:01:27.628
but maybe not in room three three three!

21
00:01:29.398 --> 00:01:30.311
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

22
00:01:30.846 --> 00:01:35.099
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> I stayed at The Langham in November last year with my husband.

23
00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:39.173
It’s a beautiful hotel, with a wonderful location.

24
00:01:39.285 --> 00:01:42.179
It’s between Hyde Park and Regent’s Park.

25
00:01:42.424 --> 00:01:45.386
We were in a room on the second floor.

26
00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:51.353
We knew that people said there were ghosts, and we knew about room three three three,

27
00:01:51.442 --> 00:01:53.680
but we weren’t worried at all.

28
00:01:54.359 --> 00:01:58.834
We had a nice meal in the hotel restaurant and then we went to bed.

29
00:01:59.224 --> 00:02:05.881
But in the middle of the night – about three in the morning – we suddenly woke up

30
00:02:05.926 --> 00:02:10.012
and we could hear loud noises from the room above us.

31
00:02:14.187 --> 00:02:21.869
They were really loud noises – like people were moving the bed or moving a heavy chair.

32
00:02:22.659 --> 00:02:28.070
Anyway, after two or three minutes, the noises stopped and we went back to sleep.

33
00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:34.059
There weren’t any more strange noises, and we slept for the rest of the night.

34
00:02:35.017 --> 00:02:38.390
The next morning, we went to Reception and said,

35
00:02:38.479 --> 00:02:44.981
‘We slept really badly last night – the people in the room above us made a terrible noise.’

36
00:02:45.682 --> 00:02:49.879
The man at reception asked for our room number and said,

37
00:02:49.879 --> 00:02:54.210
‘Let me check.’ He looked on the computer and he said,

38
00:02:54.355 --> 00:02:57.439
‘The room above you is empty, madam.’

39
00:02:57.806 --> 00:03:00.133
So I said, ‘Are you sure?’

40
00:03:00.589 --> 00:03:02.192
And he said, ‘Yes, madam.

41
00:03:02.212 --> 00:03:05.777
The room above yours is room three three three.

42
00:03:06.078 --> 00:03:09.329
There wasn’t anybody in that room last night.’

43
00:03:10.086 --> 00:03:13.337
We checked out of the hotel the same morning.

44
00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.741
Never again!